  description:
  - Since capturing a live specimen is currently deemed as "morally wrong", research
    on this creature is mostly conducted on the field. It is often debated if this
    creature is a mutated human or reanimated corpse, but there is one thing that
    is agreed upon.
  - Any form of humanity that once remained is now reduced to pure animalistic instincts.
